From b0390fcbb9c943e49697da94f9b4afd796c38e8c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: StrangeTcy <2532099+StrangeTcy@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2026 00:33:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Repair paused comparison-job resume without
 bundled-example fallback

Independent workers were discarding the restored job and searching a
different rule set. Resume a matching paused job in-process using the
requested start/goal/rules. Reject a mismatched job and a missing,
corrupted, or unmatched worker request rather than substituting a
bundled theorem.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
---
